# The ps2build SDK every RiptOPL build uses, pinned to exact releases.
#
# Build jobs never ask the official ps2build releases (github.com/ps2build) which release is newest. Every
# version below is pinned, so tools/ps2build_sdk.sh --resolve makes no network calls: the SDK cached under
# these versions is restored, and only on a cache miss is anything installed: from the official GitHub
# releases first, then, when they fail, from the private NathanNeurotic/old-ps2build-mirror release named by
# PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG (its SHA256SUMS must hash to PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256). tools/install_ps2build.sh adds the
# ogg/vorbis packages the same way. Those have no official GitHub releases (tags only), so they come from the
# mirror release named by PS2BUILD_EXTRAS_TAG (SHA256SUMS hashing to PS2BUILD_EXTRAS_SUMS_SHA256) or, when
# that is empty, by PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG.
#
# Unpinned versions used to cost 11 release-API calls in every matrix job, about 70 jobs per push.
#
# .github/workflows/ps2build-sdk-watch.yml asks once a week (.github/scripts/ps2build_sdk_watch.py), from
# ps2build's release manifest (github.com/ps2build/manifest). When anything is newer it:
#   - caches the new SDK once per toolchain on rebuild/main;
#   - opens a draft pull request that bumps the pins here, mirror release included.
#
# To keep a package on its current release (a broken upstream release), name it in PS2BUILD_SDK_HOLD: the
# weekly check then leaves it alone. Use the names below, plus llvm-toolchain, ogg and vorbis.
# Editing a version by hand? Then also clear PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG and PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256 (the mirror
# fallback then takes the newest mirror release), unless that mirror release holds exactly the new versions.
# A bare component name (no =version) still works and follows the newest release, but it costs API calls in
# every job, so CI must not use it: .github/scripts/test_ps2build_sdk_watch.py fails on one.
PS2BUILD_SDK_MIRROR=NathanNeurotic/old-ps2build-mirror
PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG=sdk-v2026.10.15-af3913e4
PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256=8c2a213998ea739849433a5cc31404706c3ece9a41eaaaaec50d35a0aa62a280
PS2BUILD_COMPONENTS="cmake=v2026.10.12 ninja=v1.13.2 ps2build=v2026.10.15 sdk-core=v2026.10.13.1 sdk-world=v2026.10.28 toolchain=v2026.09.27 tools=v2026.09.29.1 vcl=v2026.10.07"
PS2BUILD_LLVM_TOOLCHAIN=v0.3.11
PS2BUILD_EXTRAS="ogg vorbis"
OGG_VERSION=v2026.10.13
VORBIS_VERSION=v2026.10.13
PS2BUILD_SDK_HOLD=""
